            <title>Version 1.5.1</title>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 19:32:48 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Room names: give an eSpace room the name every screen shows, and keep its old address working through an eSpace rename (/config → Room names)</li>
                    <li>Warehouse shows as 2nd &amp; 3rd, Factory as 4th &amp; 5th, Treehouse as NKids Multi Purpose; old and new addresses both open the room screen</li>
                    <li>The screen picker keeps its scroll position (it jumped back to the top every 8 seconds)</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
