            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 22:02:05 +0000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>What's New</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Room screens: any eSpace room at /&lt;room name&gt; (for example /hub, /room-a) shows a doorway card — Happening now / Up next, room name in the header, big type for an iPad at the door</li>
                    <li>Screens: configured screens live at /&lt;name&gt; with their own hide rules and layout; /lobby is created on upgrade with the former global hide rules and the bare address keeps showing it until you switch it in /config → Bare address</li>
                    <li>Screen picker at /screens; Room screens and Connected screens cards in the configuration app</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
